.SH HISTORY
The fail2zig.toml format was introduced in fail2zig 0.1.0.
Quoted native duration strings were added in fail2zig 0.4.0. Backend aliases
and positioned configuration diagnostics from 0.3.0 remain supported.
The
.B on_truncation
jail key was added in fail2zig 0.4.7.
The
.BR banip ,
.BR ignoreself ,
.B ignoretime
and
.B bantime_increment_decay
keys, timed
.B banip
and
.B ignoreip
entries, and the global
.B log_format
key were added in fail2zig 0.4.8.
